  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Basst&#xF6;d till International Vaccine Institute. IVI skall bidra till att reducera sjukdomar som kan f&#xF6;rhindras genom vaccinering i utv l&#xE4;nder gnm samarbetande forskn f&#xF6;r att skapa det forskn underlag som kr&#xE4;vs f&#xF6;r rationell introduktion av nya vacciner, st&#xF6;dd av progr inom bas och applicerbar lab forskn, produktutv, utbildn o tekn ass.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to International Vaccine Inst. IVI will contribute to the reduction of vaccine preventable diseases in developing countries by collaborative research to generate the evidence needed for rational introduction of new vaccines, supported by programs of basic and applied lab.research, product dev., training, and techn. assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
